{"title":"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are non-zero numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/0/4005f84d470c2e41bf6b7fb26f222c8b2a145469.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1+\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d959883afa360e3e83c4a75bccbf66beb618707c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1+\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/e/3ce53f4ed2e9857f3ebe6b1864c07ae6fdd6f4fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } x-1\\quad \\text{(B) } 1-x\\quad \\text{(C) } 1+x\\quad \\text{(D) } -x\\quad \\text{(E) } x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"386\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see after multiplying the first equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, that \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda5bde8be1f4beb631347b6cb3ee38506b47d73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy=y+1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Similarly, we see that after multiplying the second equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we get that \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f50875a35cda9c305621562d6c25c179c1899c28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy=x+1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/103a84e2e534a1df2dd9cb3e3fbc5c9ff185f9a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1=y+1 \\implies x=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"202\" height=\"17\" />, giving us our final answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb17081eb51114c0c139d3075a3ce9ed2f301cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>~SirAppel\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can first combine the fraction on the second equation, which is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b777c9b0489ba0021ac4b4b3d4b63852b567c9ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\dfrac{x+1}{x}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Then, substituting the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> from the first equation, we can get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/a/4ea9baad4069516e6ac6f2c67d26bd1f52be4353.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\dfrac{1+\\dfrac{1}{y}+1}{1+\\dfrac{1}{y}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -39px\" width=\"121\" height=\"87\" />\n</p><p>Then, multiplying the denominator on both sides, we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/9/df97c073aa350f330324239dfbca5721f4422b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y+1=2+\\dfrac{1}{y} \\implies y=1+\\dfrac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"240\" height=\"42\" /> which is equivalent to the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that was originally provided, giving the final answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb17081eb51114c0c139d3075a3ce9ed2f301cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>~TurtleGod7\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME\" title=\"1968 AHSME\">1968 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1968 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1968\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1968 AHSME Pro